      {
        "yPos": 26,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Service Ownership & Escalation",
          "text": {
            "content": "## Service Ownership\n\n**Primary Owner:** Engineering Team  \n**Service Tier:** Tier 1 (Critical)  \n**On-Call Rotation:** Weekly rotation (primary + secondary)\n\n## Escalation Contacts\n\n- **L1 (Alert fires):** Primary on-call (15-min response SLA)\n- **L2 (Primary unavailable or >30min):** Secondary on-call\n- **L3 (Issue persists >1h):** Engineering Lead\n- **L4 (Issue persists >2h or data loss):** VP/CTO\n\n## Alert Rules\n\n**SLO Burn Rate Alerts:**\n- `SLOBudgetFastBurn` (P1): 1h burn rate > 14.4x AND 5m burn rate > 14.4x\n- `SLOBudgetSlowBurn` (P2): 6h burn rate > 6x AND 30m burn rate > 6x\n- `SLOBudgetExhausted` (P1): Error budget < 0%\n- `SLOBudgetCritical` (P1): Error budget < 10%\n\n**Performance Regression Alerts:**\n- `LatencyRegressionSpike` (P2): p95 latency > 2x 7-day baseline for 15 minutes\n- `ErrorRateSpike` (P1): 5xx error rate > 3x 7-day average for 10 minutes\n\n**Alert Definitions:** [deploy/k8s/base/monitoring/prometheusrule-slo.yaml](/deploy/k8s/base/monitoring/prometheusrule-slo.yaml)\n\n## Runbooks\n\n- [On-Call Observability Playbook](/docs/operations/ONCALL_OBSERVABILITY_PLAYBOOK.md)\n- [SLO/SLA Service Level Management Spec](/specs/slo-sla-service-level-management_spec.md)\n- [Deployment Runbook](/docs/operations/DEPLOYMENT_RUNBOOK.md)\n- [Troubleshooting Guide](/docs/operations/TROUBLESHOOTING.md)",
            "format": "MARKDOWN"
          }
        },
